OL,3,GNEWSASadness as vandals damage
OL,4,Adinosaurs on free trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter model dinosaurs on a free trail
OL,8,Fwere vandalised.
OL,10,FRoarminster in Warminster, Wiltshire,
OL,11,Fwas enjoyed by families over the
OL,12,Fsummer, but a brachiosaurus at Chinns
OL,13,FCourt had its head removed over the
OL,14,Fweekend and a cage around a T-Rex by St
OL,15,FLawrence Chapel was damaged.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
