OL,3,GNEWSASadness as vandals damage
OL,4,Adinosaurs on free trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarminster town councillor Stacie
OL,7,FAllensby said there was a feeling of
OL,8,Fanger in the town. "It was a fantastic
OL,9,Fevent and did a lot for the town - we
OL,10,Fwere hoping to do more events like this
OL,11,Fand somebody has just ruined it," she
OL,12,Fadded.
OL,14,FThe head was returned on Sunday but the
OL,15,Fcouncil said it wanted to identify who
OL,16,Fwas responsible. Wiltshire Police
OL,17,Fappealed for anyone with information to
OL,18,Fcome forward.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
